	quest.7B7F34E2C34E28FA.title: "Biological Creation"
	quest.7B93B2FF22CFFC5F.quest_desc: ["Some fish only reveal themselves in the dark, and some at daylight. There are many ways to view &oTime&r, but one of the more convenient ones would be the &6&oPocket Watch&r. Whether held in either of your hands or put in the Informational curios slot, the time becomes clear, shown in the bottom left of your screen."]
	quest.7CC42784803FC670.quest_desc: [
		"With all needed supplies, draw aviars circle and summon a foliot crusher"
		"Hint: You can use the dictionary to make a visible ghost of the pentacle"
	]
	quest.7CD9757E1CD48E5A.quest_desc: [
		"The Volitans is a highly territorial semi-aquatic dragon species adapted for environmental control, area denial, and prolonged territorial occupation. Volitans individuals are known for gradually altering surrounding environments through the accumulation of toxins and venomous biological residue. Volitans pursue prey over long distances. And they also establish dominance by controlling movement within their territory, forcing intruders into increasingly hazardous conditions through toxic spines, lingering breath attacks, and environmental pressure. Although often associated with toxicity, Volitans' activity is not inherently destructive. Once territorial disturbances cease, affected ecosystems frequently stabilize over time, suggesting the species alters environments as a defensive adaptation rather than out of indiscriminate aggression. &n&4If met in the wild, it will view a person as hostile.&r"
		"Before a Volitans can be tamed, &4&nit must first be subdued in combat&r. Wild Volitans become vulnerable only after their health is &4&nreduced to approximately 60 HP&r, causing the dragon to enter a stunned state. Once stunned, the dragon may be fed preferred foods such as &n&4tropical fish, pufferfish, raw cod, salmon, and Hearty Dragon Meal&r."
		"Feeding a Volitans does not guarantee successful taming. Failed attempts will restore a portion of the dragon's health, immediately ending its stunned state and forcing the player to subdue it again."
		"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/volitans.png width:300 height:150 align:center}"
	]
	quest.7CD9757E1CD48E5A.quest_subtitle: "Tame a Volitans"
	quest.7CD9757E1CD48E5A.title: "Mors per Venenum"
	quest.7CF4BBE81E1A7D4A.quest_desc: [
		"bishop@romulus:~$ cat ch-004.jv"
		"Indentifier: ch-004 | Informal Name: Hematoma"
		"-------------------------------------------"
		"We were given a rather odd subject. A pig who had reportedly been infected by another ch-001. Already in containment, we watched it for changes. After enough time had passed, ch-004 emerged."
		"An odd subject next to its bretheren, ch-004 does not portray any substancial resistance to outside damage. It appears rather weak in comparison. Instead, chemical analysis shows a gas emitted by ch-004 that appears to attract animals and mobs towards it. What's interesting is that the gas causes hostility in those capable. It's almost as if this creature is meant to die."
		""
		"___Report Date: 1986-07-18___"
		"Previous theories proved true when ch-004 was killed by a captured skeleton. Upon its death, ch-004 exploded, relasing a splash of blood that came into contact with a researcher's wolf, infecting it, and giving birth to ch-005"
	]
	quest.7CF4BBE81E1A7D4A.title: "ch-004 \"Hematoma\""
	quest.7CF531E5081C9D69.quest_desc: ["Rituals are a large part of the dark arts. There are many types that we will get into later, but for now, let us focus on the core of them all, the &o&6Dark Altar&r. In addition to this, we will need to craft a &oCursed Cage&r and some &oPedestals&r. The Altar and Pedestals can be made from a variety of stones, but the cage will require &6&ocursed metal&r."]
	quest.7CF531E5081C9D69.title: "The Start of Rituals"
	quest.7D3489901AA47547.quest_desc: [
		"The Town Hall is the central building in your colony. It provides lots of helpful information about your colony such as citizen stats, open work orders, citizen happiness, allies and more. "
		""
		"The settings tab should be a first stop for any new colonist as it contains options for hiring mode, housing assignment mode, and options to allow kids to be born. Also, this is where you can customize your colony flag. Your flag will appear on guard towers and guard shields. "
	]
	quest.7D3489901AA47547.quest_subtitle: "Build the Town Hall"
	quest.7D46AEE85AF5EFAF.quest_desc: [
		"The Soul Forge is one of the more interesting structures in the realm. Not much is known about its creation. One thing is for sure, though. While its inhabitants vanished, &4&oThe Netherite Monstrosity&r remained."
		"Given its unique construction, it may be possible to locate it through the usage of an Eye of Monstrous. How you'd create one is beyond me, but I'm sure an &o&6eye of ender&r would be required, &o&6along with some material from the monstrosity itself&r."
		"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/soul-blacksmith.png width:156 height:90 align:center}"
	]
	quest.7D46AEE85AF5EFAF.title: "A Terrible Creation"
	quest.7D645F0D269AB2EE.quest_desc: ["The fog diffuser spreads fog in a large area, allowing vampires to freely roam during the day."]
	quest.7D6F2EC87AA8F366.quest_desc: [
		"You've created a powerful utility in the Soul Light Focus, but if you wish to take things further, then we shall look at creating a &o&6Soul Bolt Focus&r. This focus serves as a simple projectile, and not much more. Still, it can be amplified later through enchantments and powerful items. You will need some arrows and ectoplasm, along with the Soul Light Focus you crafted earlier. I also recommend making a second Soul Light Focus, as to not strip away a useful tool to gain a weapon."
		""
		"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/soul-bolt.png width:156 height:90 align:center}"
	]
	quest.7D6F2EC87AA8F366.title: "A Caster's First Blaster"
	quest.7D797EC1976FD2E0.quest_desc: [
		"As a vampire, you will receive buffs to your speed, health, and strength. You will also no longer need to breathe under water, but water will weaken you."
		"Open the vampire menu either by clicking the button in your inventory or through the keybind (Default P)"
	]
	quest.7D9272CEE9C29156.quest_desc: ["After reaching max level, you can talk to the vampire representative and accept a task to become a Vampire Lord. One of the requirements is pure blood, which only drops from Vampire Barons in the Vampire Forest"]
	quest.7D9272CEE9C29156.title: "Become Vampire Lord"
	quest.7DA024433105259D.quest_desc: ["Got your engine? Good, now let me introduce two key crafting components, &6&othe hull and large sail&r. These will be the bulding blocks of your ships, save an exception."]
	quest.7DA024433105259D.title: "Building Blocks of The Brothers"
	quest.7DB5674EB574A1AD.quest_desc: [
		"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"On\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"e o\"},{\"text\":\"f the m\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"ain m\"},{\"text\":\"achines you'll \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"u\"},{\"text\":\"se is \"},{\"italic\":true,\"color\":\"gold\",\"text\":\"The Decomposer\"},{\"text\":\". It w\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"il\"},{\"text\":\"l take in \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"ite\"},{\"text\":\"ms and bre\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"a\"},{\"text\":\"k them down to th\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"eir m\"},{\"text\":\"aterial com\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"pone\"},{\"text\":\"nts. Like al\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"l oth\"},{\"text\":\"er mac\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"hin\"},{\"text\":\"es, you mus\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"t s\"},{\"text\":\"upply the Decomposer with \"},{\"italic\":true,\"color\":\"gold\",\"text\":\"nutrients\"},{\"text\":\", which ca\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"n\"},{\"text\":\" be done by \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"pl\"},{\"text\":\"acing food i\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"n the s\"},{\"text\":\"lot on the \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"l\"},{\"text\":\"eft.\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
		"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"Af\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"te\"},{\"text\":\"r that, \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"yo\"},{\"text\":\"u just need \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"to p\"},{\"text\":\"ut in the items yo\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"u w\"},{\"text\":\"ish to break \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"do\"},{\"text\":\"wn and wait. The\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"s\"},{\"text\":\"e materials \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"wil\"},{\"text\":\"l be used heavily in rec\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"ipe\"},{\"text\":\"s from \"},{\"italic\":true,\"color\":\"gold\",\"text\":\"The Bio-Forge\"},{\"text\":\".\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
		"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/decomposer.png width:100 height:110 align:center}"
	]
	quest.7DB5674EB574A1AD.title: "Break It Down"
	quest.7DC5F505120655C1.quest_desc: [
		"You've obtained your wand at last, but you should not go off trying to cast a spell so quickly. To do so, one requires &6&oa focus&r. There are many different focuses, but a simple one to start with is the &o&6Soul Light Focus&r. With some sticks, coal of any kind, and an empty focus, you will be able to create it."
		"Now armed with a focus, inset it into your wand with the appropriate binding (Default: Z). You can now cast the spell and shoot a projectile that upon hitting a surface with leave a small but ever present light."
		"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/soul-light.png width:156 height:90 align:center}"
	]
	quest.7DC5F505120655C1.title: "Soul Light, Soul Bright"
	quest.7EF2EEABBBAFC489.quest_desc: [
		"Well now, you wish to continue learning the arts? Good, very good. In that case, I will teach you more."
		"Before we continue, I believe it is best we tackle the creation of magical components. In the past, you created them through your totem, but there exists a better method. &o&6A Cursed Infuser&r will utilize the energy of the spawners located within this world to transform items."
		"If you don't have access to a spawner, do not worry. The infuser will still come in handy later."
	]
	quest.7EF2EEABBBAFC489.title: "A More Efficient Source"
	quest.7EFAB0353D571EF1.quest_desc: [
		"The Varasuchus is a highly adaptive semi-aquatic dragon species known for its phase-shifting combat behavior and deceptive threat presentation. Varasuchus individuals initially appear restrained and energy-efficient, often displaying limited aggression during early encounters. Varasuchus relies heavily on delayed escalation. Sustained threats trigger a drastic physiological transition in posture, musculature, and combat behavior, shifting the species from a quadrupedal stance into a far more aggressive bipedal combat phase. This transformation is not believed to be emotional, but tactical. Once escalation occurs, Varasuchus abandons passive territorial tolerance entirely and engages targets with calculated, sustained aggression. Early civilizations frequently utilized domesticated Varasuchus due to their aquatic mobility and defensive potential. In their quadrupedal state, most individuals exhibit measured aggression and relatively stable behavior, leading many settlements to integrate them into fishing operations, shoreline protection, and transport across difficult terrain. When met in the wild, they are typically neutral."
		"Unlike many dragon species, &4&nVarasuchus are not subdued through direct combat&r. Instead, taming &4&nrequires the rider to remain mounted long enough to exhaust and destabilize the dragon's resistance&r. Wild Varasuchus will violently attempt to throw riders off during the process, &n&4requiring repeated mounting attempts before successful domestication can occur&r."
		""
		"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/varasuchus.png width:300 height:169 align:center}"
	]
	quest.7EFAB0353D571EF1.quest_subtitle: "Tame a Varasuchus"
	quest.7EFAB0353D571EF1.title: "Resilience"
	quest.7F06FB2A64E173E7.title: "Pale Steel"
	quest.7F07053E02B170CB.quest_desc: ["The Deer Familiar grants its owner jump boost. When upgraded, it attacks mobs with a hammer."]
	quest.7F07053E02B170CB.title: "Deer Familiar"
	quest.7F6C368A42506322.quest_desc: ["Did you know The Nether is home to some of its own fish? Indeed it is, but fishing in lava is no simple task. The heat will melt your hook the moment it hits. To circumvent this, you can craft a lava proof hook. When this hook's attached, fishing in lava is no different from water."]
	quest.7F6C368A42506322.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Lava-Proof Fishing Hook"
	quest.7F6C368A42506322.title: "A Reel Hot Catch"
	quest.7F6CCD0F5E1C02C3.title: "Kill the Wither Necromancer"
	quest.7F8AA45AD32EDB24.quest_desc: [
		"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"Have you \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"tr\"},{\"text\":\"ied feedin\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"g the c\"},{\"text\":\"radle yet? If not, you sh\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"oul\"},{\"text\":\"d. Offe\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"r it r\"},{\"text\":\"aw meat and then a \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"s\"},{\"text\":\"acrifice with life properties, such as a he\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"alt\"},{\"text\":\"h \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"po\"},{\"text\":\"tion or \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"go\"},{\"text\":\"lden apple. It should spit out a \"},{\"italic\":true,\"color\":\"gold\",\"text\":\"flesh blob\"},{\"text\":\". These guys are raw, \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"pr\"},{\"text\":\"imal life, and they'll do n\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"othing\"},{\"text\":\" but consume wha\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"te\"},{\"text\":\"ver they can find, so ma\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"ke s\"},{\"text\":\"ure you don't ha\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"ve an\"},{\"text\":\"y pets nearby. You can also drop food on the ground for them. Whatever \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"wo\"},{\"text\":\"rks, \"},{\"italic\":true,\"color\":\"gold\",\"text\":\"as long as they eat it and grow\"},{\"text\":\".\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
		"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"Then yo\"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"u ne\"},{\"text\":\"ed to kill it. I know that sounds counterproductive, but that's the best way to get \"},{\"italic\":true,\"color\":\"gold\",\"text\":\"Living Flesh\"},{\"text\":\". The \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"la\"},{\"text\":\"rger the blob \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"is, t\"},{\"text\":\"he more flesh you'll \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"g\"},{\"text\":\"et from \"},{\"font\":\"biomancy:caro_invitica\",\"text\":\"kil\"},{\"text\":\"ling it.\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
		"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/flesh-blob.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.7F8AA45AD32EDB24.title: "Flesh and Blob"
	quest.7FCF8AE2E8F60EDF.quest_desc: ["Pistol fires Pumpkin Bullets"]
	quest.7FCF8AE2E8F60EDF.title: "Kill lord pumpkinhead"
	quest.7FE6E7B6905980AE.quest_desc: [
		"The Caustic Gunblade is a mix of melee and ranged. "
		"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/caustic-gunblade.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
